OL,3,AFrom Marilyn Monroe to Sabrina
OL,4,ACarpenter - Bob Mackie's designs in
OL,5,Apictures
OL,6,
OL,7,FIconic fashion designer Bob Mackie, who
OL,8,Fhas died aged 87, spent his career
OL,9,Fstyling the biggest stars in his
OL,10,Fsignature bedazzled, feathered and
OL,11,Fbeaded couture.
OL,13,FFrom old Hollywood's Marilyn Monroe to
OL,14,Fadorning singer Sabrina Carpenter in a
OL,15,Fpearly dress reminiscent of the 90s,
OL,16,FMackie's ensembles felt new and
OL,17,Fexciting ` even when they recalled a
OL,18,Fbygone age.
OL,20,FHere are some of his greatest designs.
